{"seq":51,"slug":"data-mesh","title":"数据网格","stage":"DONE","category":"data-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-mesh","rating":{"composite":3.96,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"数据网格\">数据网格</h1><p>数据网格（Data Mesh）是 Zhamak Dehghani 于 2019 年提出的一种去中心化数据架构范式。它不是一项具体技术或产品，而是一套将领域驱动设计、产品思维、平台工程和联邦治理融为一体的社会技术方法论，旨在解决集中式数据团队在大型组织中日益严重的瓶颈问题。</p>\n<p>与传统数据仓库或数据湖将所有数据集中到一个团队管理不同，数据网格主张让最了解数据的业务域团队自主拥有并运营数据，将分析数据视为「产品」来经营，并通过自服务平台和联邦计算治理来保证跨域互操作与合规。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>本 hub 聚焦数据网格范式本身——四大原则、数据产品设计、数据契约标准、自服务平台架构和联邦治理实现。与相邻 hub 的边界如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>MLOps 平台</strong>（<code>../50_mlops-platform/</code>）：侧重机器学习全生命周期的流水线编排、模型服务与实验追踪，数据网格为其提供上游的高质量数据产品。</li>\n<li><strong>A/B 测试与统计</strong>（<code>../5_ab-testing-statistics/</code>）：聚焦实验设计与假设检验方法论，数据网格的实验平台能力是其数据底座。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>基础篇</strong>（foundations）：理解为什么需要数据网格、四大原则的内涵以及核心术语。</li>\n<li><strong>架构篇</strong>（architecture）：掌握数据产品量子结构、数据契约标准（ODCS）和与 Data Fabric 的对比定位。</li>\n<li><strong>实施篇</strong>（implementation）：学会构建自服务数据平台、规划组织变革和分阶段落地路径。</li>\n<li><strong>运营篇</strong>（operations）：深入联邦治理的自动化执行、数据产品可观测性和成熟度演进。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>领域驱动设计（DDD）基本概念——有界上下文、统一语言</li>\n<li>微服务架构思想——独立部署、接口契约</li>\n<li>数据工程基础——ETL/ELT 流程、数据仓库与数据湖的区别</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"数据网格基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-mesh/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"centralized-bottlenecks","title":"集中式数据架构的结构性瓶颈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-mesh/foundations/centralized-bottlenecks"},{"seq":2,"slug":"four-principles","title":"数据网格四大原则深度解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-mesh/foundations/four-principles"},{"seq":3,"slug":"core-terminology","title":"数据网格核心术语与概念图谱","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-mesh/foundations/core-terminology"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"architecture","title":"数据网格架构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-mesh/architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"data-product-quantum","title":"数据产品量子结构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-mesh/architecture/data-product-quantum"},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-contracts","title":"数据契约标准与 ODCS 实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-mesh/architecture/data-contracts"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mesh-vs-fabric","title":"数据网格与数据编织的对比定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-mesh/architecture/mesh-vs-fabric"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"implementation","title":"数据网格实施","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-mesh/implementation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"self-serve-platform","title":"自服务数据平台设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-mesh/implementation/self-serve-platform"},{"seq":2,"slug":"organizational-change","title":"数据网格的组织变革策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-mesh/implementation/organizational-change"},{"seq":3,"slug":"phased-rollout","title":"数据网格分阶段实施路线图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-mesh/implementation/phased-rollout"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"数据网格运营","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-mesh/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"federated-governance-automation","title":"联邦计算治理的自动化实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-mesh/operations/federated-governance-automation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"observability","title":"数据产品可观测性体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-mesh/operations/observability"},{"seq":3,"slug":"maturity-model","title":"数据网格成熟度模型与演进路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/data-mesh/operations/maturity-model"}]}]}